      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Agreed. I know some groups are specifically for hosting events that I regularly join, so I have to put them to the top which takes a while and isn't very convenient. Other groups are just for world creator announcements or just to represent something, those can be more at the bottom.\n\nAlso to add to this, when you create a group instance, the list of groups you get seems entirely random. My own group isn't even at the top and I can imagine that this very quickly becomes a pain with creating instances when you have to spend a few minutes just scrolling through the list. Ideally it should be synced to how you have it in your normal groups menu.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
